# Vault → external React apps (Production: set on Render for the *platform* service — no redeploy if you use EXECUTION_* names)
# EXECUTION_DASHBOARD_URL=https://your-execution-app.onrender.com
# PRECONSTRUCTION_APP_URL=https://your-preconstruction-static.onrender.com
# V2V3_ACCESS_CODE=share-this-code-with-authorized-users-only
#
# Optional dev: copy into client/.env.development
# VITE_EXECUTION_DASHBOARD_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173
# VITE_PRECONSTRUCTION_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5181
#
# PreConstruction React (separate app) syncs via GET/PUT /api/preconstruction-state on this server.
# Its Vite dev server proxies /api -> PORT above (see GA_PreConstruction_React/vite.config.js).
